{{External|rs}}{{Otheruses|def=no|[[Fossil island wyvern]]s|Slayer task/Fossil Island wyverns}}[[Skeletal Wyvern]]s are level 72 [[Slayer]] monsters found in the [[Asgarnian Ice Dungeon]].

==Requirements==
*Level {{SCP|Slayer|72}} to damage skeletal wyverns. This can be [[Temporary skill boost|boosted]].
*Completion of {{SCP|Quest}}[[Elemental Workshop I]] or [[Elemental Workshop II|II]] for access to the [[Elemental shield|elemental]] or [[mind shield|mind shields]] respectively. These shields offer protection from the wyverns' powerful icy breath attack.
**Alternatively, the [[dragonfire shield]], [[ancient wyvern shield]] and [[dragonfire ward]] also offer the same protection, all requiring having started [[Dragon Slayer I]].

===Recommendations===
*High [[combat]] stats. Although not required, see the skill levels below for an indication of the advised stats:
**If using [[Melee]]:
***Level {{SCP|Attack|75}} or higher
***Level {{SCP|Strength|75}} or higher
***Level {{SCP|Hitpoints|70}} or higher
***Level {{SCP|Prayer|70}} or higher for the [[Piety]] prayer
**If using [[Ranged]]:
***Level {{SCP|Ranged|70}} or higher
***Level {{SCP|Prayer|44}} or higher for the [[Eagle Eye]] prayer
**If using [[Magic]]:
***Level {{SCP|Magic|75}} or higher for the [[Fire Wave]] [[spell]]

==Transportation==
[[File:Wyvern runner routes.png|thumb|right|Getting to the wyverns.]]
Skeletal wyverns are located in the [[Asgarnian Ice Dungeon]]. The entrance to this dungeon may be found south of [[Port Sarim]] and north of [[Mudskipper Point]]. The quickest ways to travel here are:
#Using the [[Giantsoul amulet]], teleport to Branda and Eldric's Lair and run east.
#From the [[Fairy rings|fairy ring]] at Mudskipper Point, using the code {{Fairycode|AIQ}}, and running north.
#From [[Rimmington]], via the [[Teleport to House]] spell or a [[Rimmington teleport|Rimmington teleport tablet]], or [[Captain Barnaby]], and running south-east.
#From Port Sarim, using the [[spirit tree]], an [[explorer's ring]], or the {{SCP|Minigame}} [[Rat Pits|Port Sarim Rat Pits]] minigame teleport after the completion of [[Ratcatchers]], then running south(-west).
#From the Port Sarim docks, using a [[charter ship]], or the {{SCP|Minigame}} [[Pest Control]] [[Minigame Teleport]] or [[Pest control teleport|scrolls]], and running west then south.

From the dungeon entrance, climb down the trapdoor, first run north and then run east to find an open space with [[ice warrior]]s and [[ice giant]]s. The entrance to the wyverns' lair can be found on the southern wall of this room. Players with level 72 or 82 [[Agility]] may use a shortcut [[Tunnel (Asgarnian Ice Dungeon, level 72)|before the icy area]] or [[Tunnel (Asgarnian Ice Dungeon, level 82)|right from the dungeon entrance]], respectively.
